 "title": "你读的是谁的链",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 111.99,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.232,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 2.983
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "你的系统，从来没有直接读过链。",
   "spoken": "你的系统，从来没有直接读过链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.052,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 4.15,
   "speechEnd": 6.578
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "它读的是某个节点、某个 RPC 服务、某个索引器，告诉它的链。",
   "spoken": "它读的是某个节点、某个 RPC 服务、某个索引器，告诉它的链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 7.632,
   "dur": 5.664,
   "speechStart": 7.73,
   "speechEnd": 12.456
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "数据从 P2P 网络进入节点，经过 RPC，再到索引器和你的系统。",
   "spoken": "数据从 P2P 网络进入节点，经过 RPC，再到索引器和你的系统。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 13.516,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 13.614,
   "speechEnd": 18.935
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "每一层，都可能给出错误的数据。",
   "spoken": "每一层，都可能给出错误的数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 19.976,
   "dur": 3.216,
   "speechStart": 20.074,
   "speechEnd": 22.347
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "第一层是节点客户端。",
   "spoken": "第一层是节点客户端。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 23.412,
   "dur": 2.712,
   "speechStart": 23.51,
   "speechEnd": 25.283
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "2020 年 11 月，Infura 的节点运行旧版 Geth。",
   "spoken": "2020 年 11 月，Infura 的节点运行旧版 Geth。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 26.344,
   "dur": 4.344,
   "speechStart": 26.442,
   "speechEnd": 29.858
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "它遇到一个上游已经修复的共识 bug，停在一条少数派分叉上。",
   "spoken": "它遇到一个上游已经修复的共识 bug，停在一条少数派分岔上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 30.908,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 31.006,
   "speechEnd": 35.113
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "依赖它的 MetaMask 等服务，受到影响。",
   "spoken": "依赖它的 MetaMask 等服务，受到影响。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 36.168,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 36.266,
   "speechEnd": 38.92
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "Binance、Bithumb 等交易所，暂停了 ETH 和 ERC-20 提币。",
   "spoken": "Binance、Bithumb 等交易所，暂停了 ETH 和 ERC-20 提币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 39.988,
   "dur": 5.448,
   "speechStart": 40.086,
   "speechEnd": 44.597
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "第二层是 RPC 服务，它会宕机、限流、返回过期数据。",
   "spoken": "第二层是 RPC 服务，它会宕机、限流、返回过期数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 45.656,
   "dur": 5.928,
   "speechStart": 45.754,
   "speechEnd": 50.754
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "第三层是索引器，它会延迟，也会解释错。",
   "spoken": "第三层是索引器，它会延迟，也会解释错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 51.804,
   "dur": 4.272,
   "speechStart": 51.902,
   "speechEnd": 55.259
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "第四层是网络路由。",
   "spoken": "第四层是网络路由。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 56.296,
   "dur": 2.52,
   "speechStart": 56.394,
   "speechEnd": 57.977
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "BGP 劫持，是用错误的路由宣告，把别人的流量引到自己的服务器。",
   "spoken": "BGP 劫持，是用错误的路由宣告，把别人的流量引到自己的服务器。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 59.036,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 59.134,
   "speechEnd": 64.193
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "2018 年，MyEtherWallet 的 DNS 被这样指向钓鱼站，损失约 15 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2018 年，MyEtherWallet 的 DNS 被这样指向钓鱼站，损失约 15 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 65.256,
   "dur": 6.912,
   "speechStart": 65.354,
   "speechEnd": 71.318
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "2022 年，KLAYswap 的 SDK 下载域名被劫持，下发恶意脚本，损失约 190 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2022 年，KLAYswap 的 SDK 下载域名被劫持，下发恶意脚本，损失约 190 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 72.388,
   "dur": 8.448,
   "speechStart": 72.486,
   "speechEnd": 79.986
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "同年，Celer cBridge 提供合约地址的子域被劫持，损失约 24 万美元。",
   "spoken": "同年，Celer cBridge 提供合约地址的子域被劫持，损失约 24 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 81.056,
   "dur": 6.6,
   "speechStart": 81.154,
   "speechEnd": 86.82
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "打个比方。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 87.876,
   "dur": 1.872,
   "speechStart": 87.974,
   "speechEnd": 88.759
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "你隔着一扇窗看车流，决定什么时候过马路。",
   "spoken": "你隔着一扇窗看车流，决定什么时候过马路。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-18.mp3",
   "start": 89.968,
   "dur": 3.864,
   "speechStart": 90.066,
   "speechEnd": 92.994
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "这扇窗可能是一块屏幕，屏幕可能延迟，也可能有人在播录像。",
   "spoken": "这扇窗可能是一块屏幕，屏幕可能延迟，也可能有人在播录像。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-19.mp3",
   "start": 94.052,
   "dur": 5.904,
   "speechStart": 94.15,
   "speechEnd": 99.114
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "比喻不成立的地方是，真实的马路，你可以换一扇窗再看一眼。",
   "spoken": "比喻不成立的地方是，真实的马路，你可以换一扇窗再看一眼。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-20.mp3",
   "start": 100.176,
   "dur": 5.544,
   "speechStart": 100.274,
   "speechEnd": 104.881
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "很多系统只接了一个 RPC，从来没有第二扇窗。",
